{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "Cruise",
  "theme": "cruise",
  "_about": "Cruise HUD, generated by design/gen_hud.py: calm, four trip figures down the right in soft white: range, outside temperature, the average moving speed this drive (from its first minute) and the time. Nothing else. Fitted (Nov 9 2026) to the HUD as BMW's own height-adjust frame shows it, x 120..680, y 100..380, and kept clear of the bottom-left x 120..350, y 235..380, where BMW draws its speed and speed-limit sign (and in Sport its rev band) over ours. To change it, copy this file into the app data folder layouts/ (scripts/deploy.sh); the app reloads it by itself. Widget types and tokens: see the header of hud.js.",
  "widgets": [
